 Loom Cuff   Pattern  by  Artisna
Pinwheel c onstruction pattern is created using pinwheel t ips or slanting squares that are repeated over and over. This pattern uses the slanting form –  it uses two directions of the l ine – one for the vertical and other in a slanted direction from  bottom to top.
To make these Pinwheels Loom Cuffs, first stitch the pattern on your pinwheel loom using red stitches, then take stitch markers and mark the starting line as follows: Line#1 – Stitch the red stitch in every line every third stitch, (except at the starting point);
Line #2 – Stitch the yarn between the red ones – so the third stitch is not red, the fourth can be red or white;
